  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "** Short Answer - 2.5 Marks**\n\n\nWrite a program to find the remainder when an integer **A** is divided by an integer **B**.",
    "constraints": [
      "1 **≤** **T** **≤** 1000",
      "1 **≤** **A,B** **≤** 10000"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line contains an integer **T**, the total number of test cases. Then **T** lines follow, each line contains two Integers **A** and **B**.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case, find the remainder when **A** is divided by  **B**, and display it in a new line.",
